    {
      "id": "bTlKJ2OnhLs8SXuQ6hhmL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 401.6484375,
      "y": 164,
      "width": 698.1795654296875,
      "height": 550,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1477404218,
      "version": 830,
      "versionNonce": 1345806394,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1752718618819,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements\n1. notifications system should be able to send various kinds of \n   notifications (Email, SMS, Push, Tweet, etc.,)\n2. Two types of notifications,\n    1. Single (event triggered)\n    2. Bulk (Batch process)\n\n Scale 400 QPS, 80 % bulk notifications\nbulk notifications can contain up 40 M recipients\n\nQuestions:\n1. Do we need to track the status of notifications\n2. What are the delivery semantics\n3. Should be handle duplicate notifcations\n4. QoS ?\n5. SLA for delivery ?\n \n\nNon Functional Requirements\n1. A >> C, system should be highly available \n2. System should support delivering the notifications with in SLA\n3. System should maintain QoS between different kinds of notifications",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements\n1. notifications system should be able to send various kinds of \n   notifications (Email, SMS, Push, Tweet, etc.,)\n2. Two types of notifications,\n    1. Single (event triggered)\n    2. Bulk (Batch process)\n\n Scale 400 QPS, 80 % bulk notifications\nbulk notifications can contain up 40 M recipients\n\nQuestions:\n1. Do we need to track the status of notifications\n2. What are the delivery semantics\n3. Should be handle duplicate notifcations\n4. QoS ?\n5. SLA for delivery ?\n \n\nNon Functional Requirements\n1. A >> C, system should be highly available \n2. System should support delivering the notifications with in SLA\n3. System should maintain QoS between different kinds of notifications",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
